        <mxCell id="vlTXolutErGigSJS3izG-40" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;strokeWidth=0.5;strokeColor=#808080;fontFamily=Comic Sans MS;fontSize=8;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" value="need to transfer money from an account on Shard A to an account on Shard B&lt;br&gt;&lt;div&gt;Two operations must be coordinated:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Debit the account on Shard A.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Credit the account on Shard B.&lt;br&gt;If the operation on Shard A succeeds but the operation on Shard B fails, the system must handle a partially completed transaction.&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
